                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h3] Great Retro Game Back Then, Not For Me Unfortunately 4/10 [/h3]\n\nSame things I loved and hated about UFO Defense. This is a perfect throwback if you love retro mil sim strategies, however if you don't want to put the time into learning the mechanics I'd stay away from this. If this is up your alley, definitely pick it up because X-COM frequently goes on sale with the bundle for a fair price. ($3.74 for the 5 OG titles at the time I'm typing this review.)\n\nPlenty of customization options for a game made back in '95, underwater version of the first game basically, and a kind community base. Casual and modern players I wouldn't recommend it to, but if any of the above has caught your interest give it a try!",
